  "text": "The exact scenario where Make completely crushes Zapier in speed and cost. Syncing hundreds of Shopify orders into your database through Zapier triggers massive rate-limit errors. Zapier counts every line item as a separate task, exhausting your monthly quota in hours. Make processes entire payloads as single array bundles using built-in iterators and error handlers. This protects API limits while saving thousands in subscription fees.",
